    "detailed_description": "A dark and twisted tale through the topsy-turvy and unsettling perspective of an animator.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the middle aged man attempts to animate a feature length movie all by himself, he loses connections to the people who are important to him and slowly descends himself into madness. He enters a coma from alcohol poisoning, and not only is he then trapped in the hospital... he is also trapped in messed up and straight up absurd worlds inside his mind,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring his coma, you use traditional film projectors to project different world onto the walls, allowing you to walk into them and discover his different perspectives, and finally learning about a very dark truth.",
    "about_the_game": "A dark and twisted tale through the topsy-turvy and unsettling perspective of an animator.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the middle aged man attempts to animate a feature length movie all by himself, he loses connections to the people who are important to him and slowly descends himself into madness. He enters a coma from alcohol poisoning, and not only is he then trapped in the hospital... he is also trapped in messed up and straight up absurd worlds inside his mind,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring his coma, you use traditional film projectors to project different world onto the walls, allowing you to walk into them and discover his different perspectives, and finally learning about a very dark truth.",
    "short_description": "Lens Gloss is a dark, mysterious puzzle game inside an animator\u2019s mind. You use different films to enter 3 worlds: his joyful golden past, his sombre blue present and his cold dark future.",
